
form result
  head t
  head e

  case okay
    link value, like t

  case error
    link value, like e

  task map
    head s
    take self
    take call
      like task
        take value, like t
        like s
    like result

  task map-error
    head f
    take self
    take call
      like task
        take value, like e
        like f
    like result

  task bind
    head s
    take self
    take call
      like task
        take value, like t
        like result
    like result

  task unwrap
    take self
    like t

  task unwrap-or
    take self
    take fallback, like t
    like t

  task unwrap-error
    take self
    like e

  task is-okay
    take self
    like boolean

  task is-error
    take self
    like boolean

  task to-maybe
    take self
    like maybe

  task flatten
    take self
    like result
